{"id":"92588a6191abc58b","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-ideal-normal.md","title":"Normal-Ideal Duality","display":"thm-ideal-normal — Normal-Ideal Duality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ideal-normal","aliases":["58-thm-ideal-normal"],"display":"thm-ideal-normal — Normal-Ideal Duality","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-normal-ideal.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ideal-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ideal-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ideal-normal — Normal-Ideal Duality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25913aadd8739feb\" href=\"?note=25913aadd8739feb\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-normal-ideal.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-normal-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a6025ef2eacbac3\" href=\"?note=5a6025ef2eacbac3\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (ideal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S\\)</span> (normality predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DualFilter}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{DualFilter}:V^2\\to V\\)</span> (operator defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DualFilter}(I,\\kappa)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\kappa\\setminus A\\in I\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DualFilter}(I,\\kappa)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\kappa\\setminus A\\in I\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(\\operatorname{DualFilter}(I,\\kappa),\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(\\operatorname{DualFilter}(I,\\kappa),\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Complementation converts closure under unions into closure under intersections and converts diagonal unions into diagonal intersections.  The dual filter is now an explicit set-valued operator rather than a notation introduced only in prose.</li>\n<li>The Boolean prime ideal theorem can extend a proper ideal to a maximal ideal, but it does not in general preserve <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness; the former ultrafilter claim was false.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-normal-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"25913aadd8739feb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-normal-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a6025ef2eacbac3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DualFilter}:V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DualFilter}(I,\\kappa)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\kappa\\setminus A\\in I\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(\\operatorname{DualFilter}(I,\\kappa),\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1320,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-ideal-normal.md|58-thm-ideal-normal]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["25913aadd8739feb","5a6025ef2eacbac3"]}